# AC-TG-2: auto-loaded by `bun test` into the STARTUP environment, so children spawned
# without an explicit `env` (incl. Bun.spawnSync) inherit the guard marker. A preload alone
# cannot do this. Verified by scripts/test-isolation-bun-preload.ts (fails loud if absent or
# if the repo root disagrees; ${PWD} must be packages/lore, as `cd packages/lore && bun test` gives).
LORE_TEST_SANDBOX=1
LORE_TEST_SANDBOX_REPO=${PWD}/../..
